WEBVTT

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:32.369
(Applause)

00:16:32.393 --> 00:16:35.829
Under the circumstances,
it's profoundly important

00:16:35.853 --> 00:16:38.422
that every single
American child leaves school

00:16:38.446 --> 00:16:40.423
knowing how to cook 10 recipes

00:16:40.447 --> 00:16:41.796
that will save their life.

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.019
Life skills.

00:16:44.043 --> 00:16:46.240
(Applause)

00:16:46.264 --> 00:16:49.302
That means that they can be
students, young parents,

00:16:49.326 --> 00:16:53.565
and be able to sort of duck and dive
around the basics of cooking,

00:16:53.589 --> 00:16:55.692
no matter what recession hits
them next time.

00:16:55.716 --> 00:16:58.098
If you can cook,
recession money doesn't matter.

00:16:58.122 --> 00:17:00.593
If you can cook, time doesn't matter.